5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm Yumi. Let's all work together to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm Daisuke. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll try my best to help.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Daisuke"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Daisuke**: I'm Daisuke. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll try my best to help.""}]}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I'm Asuka. Let's keep our discussion logical and focused on the facts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello, dear children. I am Shizue. Let us all stay calm and kind to one another.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shizue"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Shizue**: Hello, dear children. I am Shizue. Let us all stay calm and kind to one another.""}]}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hi, I'm Midori. I'm looking forward to working with all of you to keep our village safe.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I agree with your point. Let's stay calm and listen to everyone's thoughts carefully.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. Let's listen to everyone carefully.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Let's focus on gathering information. Who has any initial observations or suspicions to share?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"I don't have any specific suspicions yet, but I trust we will find the truth together.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Asuka. Let's listen to everyone's observations before making any judgments.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, don't be nervous! We are all in this together.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Thank you, Yumi. Your kindness helps me feel a bit more at ease.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I appreciate the sentiment, but we need concrete evidence. Who else has noticed anything unusual about the others?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"I haven't noticed anything strange yet, but I am here to support everyone. Let's keep talking gently.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I haven't noticed anything unusual yet either. Let's keep listening to each other carefully.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Let's wrap up Day 0. I hope everyone feels comfortable. We will start our real investigation tomorrow morning.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
