31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I have confirmed you are the werewolf. We must vote you out today to save the village.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know what to say. Yumi, are you sure?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I refuse to accept that accusation. Yumi, you are making a baseless claim without any proof.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I am so sorry to hear this, Yumi. I trust your judgment, but please be gentle with Asuka.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I am shocked by this sudden accusation. Yumi, please explain how you know this for certain.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Midori, I am the Seer. I checked Asuka last night and she is definitely the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know what to believe. Yumi, are you absolutely certain?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Yumi, your claim is unfounded. You are trying to manipulate the group with a false identity.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I believe you, Yumi. Your kindness and honesty are clear to me. Let us trust your word.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I am still processing this. Yumi, if you are truly the Seer, please confirm you have no other information.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Midori, I have only checked Asuka so far. I am certain she is the werewolf. Please trust me.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I am still very confused. But if Yumi is the Seer, I will try to trust her.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
